  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 807113cb1a76e7447b723d8ea432b47d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 2 angel talk
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  lines:
  - speaker: Dev Angel
    portrait: {fileID: -7337615845406242586, guid: 7bc1d3b6533da4b44bfdfbe3268b641a, type: 3}
    text: Did you really think something was gonna happen XDDDD
  - speaker: Edmund Chamar
    portrait: {fileID: -984164299818982976, guid: 1caf50aa47e18214b94fb3ee8bee0004, type: 3}
    text: .-.
  - speaker: Edmund Chamar
    portrait: {fileID: -984164299818982976, guid: 1caf50aa47e18214b94fb3ee8bee0004, type: 3}
    text: yk we are suppposed to have a plot twist in the story, this all getting
      boring as shi lowkey
  - speaker: Dev Angel
    portrait: {fileID: -7337615845406242586, guid: 7bc1d3b6533da4b44bfdfbe3268b641a, type: 3}
    text: Exactly
  - speaker: Edmund Chamar
    portrait: {fileID: -984164299818982976, guid: 1caf50aa47e18214b94fb3ee8bee0004, type: 3}
    text: then??
  - speaker: Dev Angel
    portrait: {fileID: -7337615845406242586, guid: 7bc1d3b6533da4b44bfdfbe3268b641a, type: 3}
    text: 'Fear not, child. Every life bears meaning, even that of a sorry soul such
      as thine.

      Go forth and live, rather than sit idle awaiting life to come
      knocking upon thy door. The finest moment is the present for that, after all,
      is why it is called a present.'
  - speaker: Dev Angel
    portrait: {fileID: -7337615845406242586, guid: 7bc1d3b6533da4b44bfdfbe3268b641a, type: 3}
    text: 'Now go, child. I have important matters to attend to.

      ...Such as
      reminding the dev that the theme was plot twist.'
  - speaker: Dev Angel
    portrait: {fileID: -7337615845406242586, guid: 7bc1d3b6533da4b44bfdfbe3268b641a, type: 3}
    text: And worry not, for the grand and mysterious Maya of the Dev shall forever
      watch over us.
  - speaker: Edmund Chamar
    portrait: {fileID: -984164299818982976, guid: 1caf50aa47e18214b94fb3ee8bee0004, type: 3}
    text: 'Sorry what? XO '
  - speaker: Dev Angel
    portrait: {fileID: -7337615845406242586, guid: 7bc1d3b6533da4b44bfdfbe3268b641a, type: 3}
    text: ' I shall take my leave now. May fortune smile upon thee, and may the Dev
      have mercy upon thy sorry ass.'
  - speaker: Dev Angel
    portrait: {fileID: -7337615845406242586, guid: 7bc1d3b6533da4b44bfdfbe3268b641a, type: 3}
    text: Sayonara~
